  message: "PR #2354 (stable-id v19, 2026-11-23/24), jsts agent (WI-hupad): Go interface methods are covered by the same rule. Named interface methods do not hash parameter names (already normalized), but their RESULT names are hashed by the Go rule this item names (tuple-result element names); WI-hupad did not touch it. Interface-literal methods with a named parameter were normalized by the PR (8b7c9284a), with 0 Go ids moved on caddy and alertmanager (no such literal there)."  # 35ec
